{"id":"reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy","date":"2026-11-27","topic":"design","region":"americas","headline":"Popular Children's Toy Started as Wall Cleaner","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Play-Doh"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the 1930s, a company made stuff to clean dark walls.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t1-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.55,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":6.31,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.26,1.52,1.66,2.0,2.34,2.68,2.92,3.18,3.64]},{"text":"Black smoke from home fires made the walls dark.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","C"],"dur":3.06,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":3.64,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.6,0.96,1.18,1.64,2.16,2.34,2.52]},{"text":"Later, people used new heat and walls stayed clean.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t1-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","M","S","V","C"],"dur":3.47,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":5.63,"times":[0.0,0.62,0.82,1.16,1.48,1.82,2.24,2.5,2.86]},{"text":"Children in a school loved to play with the stuff.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.06,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.95,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.54,0.64,1.0,1.7,2.14,2.34,2.54,2.66]},{"text":"The company sold the fun stuff as Play-Doh in 1956.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.8,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":6.74,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.68,0.9,1.1,1.46,1.73,2.56,2.98]}],"bands":{"core1000":96,"core1800":4,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":0},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"made the walls dark.","title":"Make + Object + Complement","note":"This pattern shows how an action causes something to reach a new condition. The verb 'made' takes 'the walls' as the object and 'dark' as the complement describing the state of the walls."},{"i":2,"focus":"walls stayed clean.","title":"Linking Verbs with Complements","note":"Linking verbs like 'stay' connect the subject directly to an adjective describing its condition. Here, 'clean' serves as the complement describing 'walls'."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"A company in Ohio created a soft material in the 1930s.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.81,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":6.14,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.54,0.84,1.36,1.96,2.28,2.56,3.12,3.54,3.66]},{"text":"People bought the material because it cleaned black dust off walls.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","M","M"],"dur":3.67,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":7.39,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.44,0.62,0.98,1.42,1.58,1.84,2.3,2.66,3.0]},{"text":"Homes changed their heat systems, so people needed less wall material.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":3.94,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":6.16,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.48,0.86,1.08,1.94,2.06,2.3,2.54,2.98,3.28]},{"text":"A teacher noticed that young children loved playing with the mix.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.9,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":6.04,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.3,0.76,1.06,1.34,1.88,2.54,3.02,3.3,3.42]},{"text":"She asked the owners to sell it as a fun school item.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":2.81,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.97,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.28,0.5,0.72,1.02,1.26,1.42,1.6,1.7,1.96,2.32]},{"text":"They named it Play-Doh and launched the product in 1956.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","C","M","V","O","O","M","M"],"dur":4.49,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":6.68,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.36,0.57,1.2,1.56,1.78,2.06,2.36,2.68]}],"bands":{"core1000":90,"core1800":8,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":0},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"because it cleaned black dust off walls.","title":"Causality Clause with 'Because'","note":"The conjunction 'because' introduces a subordinate clause explaining why people bought the material. The clause contains its own subject 'it' and verb 'cleaned'."},{"i":3,"focus":"loved playing","title":"Gerund as Object of Verb","note":"The gerund '-ing' form 'playing' acts as the noun object of the verb 'loved'. It names the activity that the children enjoyed doing."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the 1930s, Kutol Products created a soft compound, or pliable paste, to clean wallpaper.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":7.95,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":10.26,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.32,1.76,2.24,2.66,3.34,3.68,3.92,5.1,5.24,5.76,6.56,6.76,6.98]},{"text":"People used this putty because it removed dark soot, which was black coal dust, from walls.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","S","V","C","C","C","M","M"],"dur":5.8,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.55,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.52,0.86,1.26,1.62,1.74,2.04,2.54,3.5,3.54,3.72,4.08,4.38,5.04,5.14]},{"text":"Sales collapsed after American households switched from coal to cleaner natural gas heating systems.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.09,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":8.43,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.82,1.32,1.8,2.14,2.7,3.16,3.48,3.9,4.16,4.62,5.04,5.34]},{"text":"However, a nursery school teacher named Kay Zufall noticed that her students loved the material.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","M","S","S","V","O","O"],"dur":6.04,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.04,"times":[0.0,0.64,0.74,0.96,1.4,1.76,2.1,2.44,3.02,3.66,4.0,4.14,4.54,5.08,5.4]},{"text":"She persuaded the company to market the flexible compound as a fun children's toy.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.55,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.4,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.52,0.78,1.06,1.34,1.64,1.9,2.14,2.62,3.06,3.18,3.42,4.18]},{"text":"Rebranded as Play-Doh, the popular product has brought joy to kids since 1956.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t3-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.39,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.79,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.77,1.8,1.96,2.36,2.76,3.02,3.22,3.58,3.84,4.06,4.52]}],"bands":{"core1000":69,"core1800":8,"ngsl":13,"tsl":1,"nawl":0,"beyond":9},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"which was black coal dust,","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"This relative clause uses 'which' to add extra background details about 'dark soot'. Set off by commas, it provides non-essential clarification."},{"i":5,"focus":"Rebranded as Play-Doh,","title":"Past Participle Modifier","note":"A past participle phrase at the beginning of a sentence acts as a modifier for the subject that follows. Here, 'Rebranded as Play-Doh' describes 'the popular product'."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"During the 1930s, Kutol Products manufactured a flexible putty designed to remove soot from wallpaper.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.46,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.74,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.5,1.78,2.28,2.62,3.3,3.8,4.16,4.84,5.4,5.7,5.96,6.52,6.78]},{"text":"The product sold well until home heating systems shifted from coal to cleaner natural gas.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.65,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":8.03,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.26,0.6,1.0,1.54,1.86,2.2,2.64,3.04,3.42,3.76,4.22,4.52,4.98]},{"text":"Because indoor soot levels dropped sharply, demand for the specialized wallpaper cleaner plummeted.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","V"],"dur":6.12,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.12,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.56,1.08,1.3,1.76,2.88,3.12,3.52,3.62,4.0,4.54,5.18]},{"text":"The company faced severe financial problems until a nursery school teacher suggested a new purpose.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":5.88,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":7.15,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.28,0.56,1.02,1.64,2.3,2.94,3.08,3.34,3.78,4.1,4.56,4.92,5.18]},{"text":"Kay Zufall reported that her young students thoroughly enjoyed shaping the non-toxic substance into art projects.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.54,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":8.47,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.64,1.12,1.42,1.56,1.8,2.36,2.84,3.34,3.88,4.11,4.7,5.24,5.64,5.82]},{"text":"She urged company executives to remarket the flexible modeling compound as a children's toy.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.26,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":8.75,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.42,0.86,1.4,1.72,2.46,2.58,2.9,3.44,3.82,4.26,4.36,4.96]},{"text":"Renamed Play-Doh, the product was introduced to schools and major department stores in 1956.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.98,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.56,"times":[0.0,0.61,1.38,1.6,1.82,2.06,2.36,2.72,3.08,3.4,3.64,4.02,4.44,4.72]},{"text":"Television advertisements soon transformed the former wall cleaner into a massive commercial success.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.87,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":6.78,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.84,1.46,2.06,2.38,2.62,2.98,3.26,3.74,3.86,4.32,4.72]}],"bands":{"core1000":67,"core1800":7,"ngsl":10,"tsl":5,"nawl":2,"beyond":9},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"Because indoor soot levels dropped sharply,","title":"Adverbial Clause of Cause","note":"Placing an adverbial cause clause led by 'because' at the beginning emphasizes the cause before stating the main effect. It functions as an adverbial modifier for the main clause."},{"i":6,"focus":"was introduced","title":"Passive Voice","note":"The passive form 'was introduced' places the main focus on the receiver of the action ('the product') rather than who performed the action. This structure is useful in formal writing."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the 1930s, Cincinnati-based Kutol Products developed a soft, doughy compound specifically to remove coal soot from indoor wallpaper.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":10.06,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":14.53,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.28,0.93,2.5,3.08,3.46,4.06,4.42,5.1,5.6,6.1,6.9,7.5,7.74,8.18,8.62,8.84,9.06]},{"text":"As American households increasingly transitioned to natural gas heating after World War II, indoor soot build-up diminished dramatically.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","M"],"dur":8.26,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.22,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.76,1.4,2.12,2.58,2.9,3.32,3.74,4.12,4.36,4.54,5.68,5.68,5.99,6.56,7.08]},{"text":"Consequently, demand for the specialized cleaner plummeted, leaving the struggling soap manufacturer on the brink of potential bankruptcy.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.69,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":9.14,"times":[0.0,0.72,0.96,1.36,1.44,1.8,2.22,3.48,3.64,3.84,4.2,4.58,5.2,5.64,5.74,6.1,6.38,6.66]},{"text":"Salvation arrived when nursery school teacher Kay Zufall discovered a creative alternative application for the remaining cleaning compound.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.83,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":9.88,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.86,1.28,1.52,1.98,2.34,2.68,3.3,3.72,4.06,4.54,5.06,5.78,6.2,6.28,6.58,7.06]},{"text":"After observing how eagerly her young students molded the pliable material into artwork, she convinced company leaders to pivot.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","C","C"],"dur":7.41,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":11.37,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.52,0.78,1.16,1.62,1.8,2.26,2.64,2.9,3.38,3.78,4.16,5.04,5.28,5.54,6.06,6.48,6.78]},{"text":"While the inventors originally favored the name Rainbow Modeling Compound, Zufall and her husband coined the punchier brand Play-Doh.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.46,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":11.37,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.2,0.58,1.12,1.44,1.72,1.92,2.42,3.2,4.1,4.56,4.72,4.84,5.24,5.58,5.82,6.28,6.72]},{"text":"The reworked compound was demonstrated at an educational convention in 1956 before securing shelf space in prestigious department stores.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.08,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":8.97,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.5,0.96,1.22,1.68,2.06,2.16,2.5,3.2,3.52,4.28,5.12,5.19,5.23,5.27,5.29,5.38,5.46]},{"text":"Promoted heavily through popular children's television broadcasts starting in 1957, Play-Doh quickly evolved into an iconic global childhood staple.","voice":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/t5-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.19,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-design-popular-children-s-toy/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":13.63,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.56,0.96,1.32,1.88,2.04,2.7,3.24,3.44,4.14,5